tweaksplus (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support Ubuntu 26.04 and CachyOS GNOME with the same binary.
  * Skip unavailable GSettings keys instead of aborting on rolling releases.
  * Fall back to idle-action keys where GNOME 51 removed lid-close actions.
  * Add Arch/CachyOS packaging and portable release archives.

